# This repo holds no source — only the README, the notices, whatever is
# attached to a GitHub Release, and docs/, which is the browser demo GitHub
# Pages serves. docs/ is the one exception to "no build output", and it is
# committed on purpose: Pages can only publish what is in the repository, and
# the demo is built from the private source repo where Pages cannot reach it.
# Staged release artifacts are a different matter — built there and uploaded,
# never committed: they're tens of megabytes each and Releases already stores
# them.
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.dmg
*.app/
dist/

# OS junk
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
